{"id":"wb-7-1198","name":"寨卜昌村古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"寨卜昌村古建筑群","text":"寨卜昌村古建筑群位于中华人民共和国河南省焦作市苏家作乡寨卜昌村，由明清民居、王氏宗祠及寨墙、寨河、石桥等组成。现存房屋少数建于明末清初，多数建于清乾隆、嘉庆和道光年间，村落保留了住宅院落与外围防御设施相结合的布局。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%A8%E5%8D%9C%E6%98%8C%E6%9D%91%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":95427223,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95427223","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/552c0cbb0890bb5be581fea3.jpg","title":"20230512_Traditional_Residences_of_Zhaibuchang_Village_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20230512_Traditional_Residences_of_Zhaibuchang_Village_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/20230512_Traditional_Residences_of_Zhaibuchang_Village_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Traditional Residences of Zhaibuchang Village","width":320,"height":213}}